  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.3 - CRITICAL FIX: Resolved application crash caused by hardcoded version paths in applicationHost.xdt. Now uses Azure placeholders (%XDT_EXTENSIONPATH%) for dynamic path resolution with correct extracted paths (content\\ prefix stripped by Azure). This fix prevents KUDU and application pool crashes during deployment. Additional improvements: Enhanced NuGet package metadata with detailed feature descriptions, accurate release notes, and comprehensive documentation. Complete fire-and-forget async pattern using System.Threading.Channels for lock-free queue processing. Circuit breaker implementation with Polly v8 for resilient API communication.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "summary": "Enterprise-grade HTTP traffic collector for Azure App Services with zero-latency fire-and-forget pattern, circuit breaker resilience, and multi-framework support (.NET 6/8/9)",
